WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Skinner proposed using trained pigeons in a guidance system.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The birds learned a response to an image, rather than a human mission plan.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A surviving nose cone and training film document real research.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The system did not become a combat weapon. Separate the task from the mission.
